const: #b593 = The b5(9³) algorithm cyclic sequence of numbers arranged in a 5x5 grid. Each row is a shifted version of the sequence `{1, 3, 5, 7, 9}`. It represents the Base 5 (B5) system, where each number corresponds to a symbolic or elemental value > `#algorithm help algorithms/b593:main`
const: #VedicThreefoldAlgorithm = Vedic Threefold Algorithm harnessing Goodness, Passion, Ignorance > `#algorithm help algoritms/VedicThreefoldAlgorithm:main`
